<script lang="ts">import {onMount,getContext} from 'svelte';import type {I18nState} from '../../../../../lib/i18n/i18n.svelte';import {createPreferredBinsState} from '../state/preferredBinsState.svelte';const i18n=getContext<I18nState>('i18n');const vm=createPreferredBinsState();let itemId=$state(''),binId=$state(''),priority=$state('1');onMount(()=>{void vm.load();});async function add(){if(await vm.create({itemId:Number(itemId),binId:Number(binId),priority:Number(priority)})){itemId='';binId='';priority='1';}}async function changePriority(id:number,current:number){const next=prompt('Nueva prioridad (1-100)',String(current));if(next!==null&&/^\d+$/.test(next))await vm.update(id,Number(next));}async function remove(id:number){if(confirm('¿Eliminar esta ubicación preferida?'))await vm.remove(id);}</script>
<section class="page"><header><div><p class="eyebrow">ABELLIS · SMART WMS</p><h1>{i18n.t('Ubicaciones preferidas')}</h1><p>{i18n.t('Asigna ubicaciones Pickable y define su orden de prioridad por producto.')}</p></div></header>
{#if vm.error}<p class="error" role="alert">{vm.error}</p>{/if}
<form class="editor" onsubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();void add();}}><label>{i18n.t('ID de producto')}<input type="number" min="1" required bind:value={itemId}/></label><label>{i18n.t('ID de ubicación Pickable')}<input type="number" min="1" required bind:value={binId}/></label><label>{i18n.t('Prioridad')}<input type="number" min="1" max="100" required bind:value={priority}/></label><button class="primary" type="submit" disabled={vm.saving}>{i18n.t('Añadir ubicación')}</button></form>
<div class="toolbar"><input type="search" placeholder={i18n.t('Buscar por SKU o producto')} value={vm.search} oninput={e=>vm.setSearch(e.currentTarget.value)} onkeydown={e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')void vm.load();}}/><button onclick={()=>void vm.load()}>{i18n.t('Buscar')}</button></div>
{#if vm.loading}<p>{i18n.t('Cargando…')}</p>{:else if vm.rows.length===0}<p class="empty">{i18n.t('No hay ubicaciones preferidas registradas.')}</p>{:else}<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>SKU</th><th>{i18n.t('Producto')}</th><th>{i18n.t('Ubicación')}</th><th>{i18n.t('Zona')}</th><th>{i18n.t('Prioridad')}</th><th>{i18n.t('Acciones')}</th></tr></thead><tbody>{#each vm.rows as r (r.preferredBinId)}<tr><td>{r.sku??'—'}</td><td>{r.itemName??'—'}</td><td>{r.binCode??r.binId}</td><td>{r.zoneName??'—'}</td><td>{r.priority}</td><td><button onclick={()=>void changePriority(r.preferredBinId,r.priority)}>{i18n.t('Cambiar prioridad')}</button><button class="danger" onclick={()=>void remove(r.preferredBinId)}>{i18n.t('Eliminar')}</button></td></tr>{/each}</tbody></table></div>{/if}</section>
<style>.page{max-width:78rem;margin:1.4rem auto;padding:0 1.1rem;color:var(--ink)}header{margin-bottom:1rem}h1{margin:0;font:700 1.6rem var(--disp)}header p{color:var(--slate);font-size:.9rem}.eyebrow{font:600 .65rem var(--disp);letter-spacing:.14em}.editor{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card)}label{display:grid;gap:.3rem;color:var(--slate);font-size:.8rem}input{min-height:39px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:.5rem .65rem;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink)}button{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:.55rem .8rem;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.primary{background:var(--navy);color:white;border-color:var(--navy)}.danger,.error{color:var(--danger)}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin:1rem 0}.toolbar input{flex:1}.table-wrap{overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card)}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;white-space:nowrap;font-size:.84rem}th,td{text-align:left;padding:.7rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}th{color:var(--slate);font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase}.empty{color:var(--slate);padding:2rem 0}</style>